Aerie-Purpose: Make the version that About and chrome://version show next to the Chromium version Aerie's own release number, not Helium's.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: base/version_info/version_info_values.h.version (HELIUM_PRODUCT_VERSION)
Aerie-Kind: branding

The AERIE_MAJOR, AERIE_MINOR and AERIE_PATCH values are added to
chrome/VERSION from the AERIE_VERSION file by the "aerie version" build layer
(tools/aerie_build/aerie_version.py). The macro keeps Helium's name so that
Helium's version UI patch needs no change.

--- a/base/version_info/version_info_values.h.version
+++ b/base/version_info/version_info_values.h.version
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@
 #if !BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID)
 #define PRODUCT_VERSION "@MAJOR@.@MINOR@.@BUILD@.@PATCH@"
 #endif
-#define HELIUM_PRODUCT_VERSION "@HELIUM_MAJOR@.@HELIUM_MINOR@.@HELIUM_PATCH@.@HELIUM_PLATFORM@"
+#define HELIUM_PRODUCT_VERSION "@AERIE_MAJOR@.@AERIE_MINOR@.@AERIE_PATCH@"
 #define LAST_CHANGE "@LASTCHANGE@"
 #define IS_OFFICIAL_BUILD @OFFICIAL_BUILD@
 
